+# THIS TABLE IS THE NO-FLAG-DAY MECHANISM. Normalising at the single
+# construction chokepoint means a reader compares against a canonical member
+# and never against a spelling. Adopting a different role vocabulary is
+# therefore rows in this table plus a changed `Role`, with ZERO changes to the
